# Spider-Man Noir {4}{B} 4/4 menace: "Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, put a +1/+1 counter on it. Then surveil X, where
# X is the number of counters on it" (CR 508.1, 122.1, 701.25). The first attack makes one counter and surveils 1 (Forest to the
# graveyard); the second makes two counters and surveils 2 (Island and Savannah to the graveyard), so X counts every counter on it.

